{"id":"vod_bf_151082","vodId":"151082","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"被追放的转生重骑士用游戏知识开无双","name_cn":"被追放的转生重骑士用游戏知识开无双","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第16集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260703-1/46b1a1365cdd7b13bdd9dd6f0b6f7414.webp"},"summary":"“重骑士”——那是一个以防御为主，吸引敌人攻击以保护队友的职业。然而，与其他防御职业相比，其性能缺乏灵活性，攻击性能过低，导致连等级都难以正常提升。因此，它被称为超越了“不幸”的“缺陷”职业。 出生于代代相传“剑圣”血脉的埃德温伯爵家的埃尔玛，在作为继承人的重要仪式“加护仪式”中，觉醒了被称为“缺陷”职业的“重骑士”，不仅失去了下一任家主的地位，还被不公正地放逐了。然而，在那时他恢复了前世的记忆，并意识到这个世界与他生前沉迷的 VR 在线游戏《Magic World》完全相同。然后，埃尔玛知道了。“重骑士”才是最强的职业……被伯爵家放逐后成为独行冒险者的埃尔玛，充分利用生前的知识，开始高效地攻略这个世界。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-16 00:19:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.baofeng9.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/35af2746ea44/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/2e9e658c1ce2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/753454f0b503/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/1c56cc039385/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/bbd8331496a8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/d3f9f7037ed8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/d2ab398ca93f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishiyongyouxizhishikaiwushuang/e765f25de88a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/beizhuizhudezhuanshengzhongqishi